  "name": "Chicken Jambalaya",
  "subtitle": "A savory rice skillet with vegetables and tender chicken",
  "description": "Cook rice with tomatoes, broth, herbs, and vegetables, then fold in cubed chicken for a hearty, gently spicy meal.",
